  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></strong></span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>原版礦石</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>英文</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>你懷舊嗎？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>此材質包為您的我的世界增添了舊版 Minecraft 材質。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>所有礦物材質均低於 1.17 版本。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>包含：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 原版礦物（金、鑽石、鐵……）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙文</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>你懷舊嗎？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>這個材質包為你的我的世界添加了舊版 Minecraft 材質。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>所有礦物材質均為 1.17 之前的版本。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>包含：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 原版礦物（金、鐵、鑽石、祖母綠……）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fddediegood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_68549b52-a129-4666-80cb-67f09f5d